      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Faster paths: keepalived stopped -> priority-0 advert (~0.3 s); HAProxy killed -> track_process sends FAULT at once (< 1 s).\nIf the FIP does not follow: fallback F1 (notify script moves the FIP via the Neutron API) or F2 (Octavia ovn L4 LB).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 512879119,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
