      "text": "Faster paths: keepalived stopped -> priority-0 advert (~0.3 s); HAProxy killed -> track_process sends FAULT at once (< 1 s).\nIf the FIP does not follow: fallback F1 (notify script moves the FIP via the Neutron API) or F2 (Octavia ovn L4 LB).",
